    "body": "Hi @aw1cks, at the moment we can't exclude some extension but I think we could update the files that trigger the terraform module to be a bit more precise. I think you should be able to add the following to your starship config file as a work around until we fix this. \n\n```diff\n[terraform] \n+detect_extensions = [\"tf\"]\n```",
